{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מְאָה","hw":"מְאָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְאָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. hundred (</strong>v. BH<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> after noun enum., <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:17\" href=\"/Ezra.6.17\">Ezr 6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:22\" href=\"/Ezra.7.22\">7:22</a><sup>(×4)</sup>, so <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְבַּע מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:17\" href=\"/Ezra.6.17\">6:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ וְעֶשְׂרִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:2\" href=\"/Daniel.6.2\">Dn 6:2</a>, and du. <span dir=\"rtl\">מָאתַ֫יִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:17\" href=\"/Ezra.6.17\">Ezr 6:17</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, מֹאזַנְיָא²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, מָא"}